/* .kachat registry v3: prices from the price record, the period clock, declining offers */
"This name is already paid up to its longest period. Renewal opens on %@." = "此名称已支付至最长期限。续期于 %@ 开放。";
"The price record is busy right now. Try again in a moment." = "价格记录正忙。请稍后再试。";
"You can't make an offer on your own name." = "你不能对自己的名称报价。";
"An offer can run for up to 7 days." = "报价最长可持续 7 天。";
"Price per %@" = "每 %@ 价格";
"Available · %@ per %@" = "可用 · 每 %2$@ %1$@";
"Extend to %@" = "延长至 %@";
"Pays for more time now, up to the %@ limit." = "现在支付更多时长，上限为 %@。";
"Extending adds time to the current paid period, which holds at most %@. The price goes to the miners." = "延长会为当前已付期限增加时长，期限最多 %@。费用归矿工。";
"The name is yours for the time you paid, at most %@ ahead. From %@ before it expires you can renew it." = "名称在你支付的时长内归你所有，最多提前 %1$@。到期前 %2$@ 起即可续期。";
"Decline Offer" = "拒绝报价";
"Offer declined" = "报价已拒绝";
"The offer goes back to the buyer. Its network fee comes out of the offer, so declining costs you nothing." = "报价会退还给买家。网络费从报价中扣除，所以拒绝不会让你花费任何费用。";
"Your KAS stays locked on chain until the owner accepts or declines, you withdraw the offer, or it expires - then anyone can send it back to you." = "你的 KAS 会锁定在链上，直到所有者接受或拒绝、你撤回报价或报价到期——之后任何人都可以把它退还给你。";
"This name is listed for less than your offer. Consider buying it instead." = "此名称的挂牌价低于你的报价。不如直接购买。";

/* .kachat: never pay more than the confirmed price (IOS-054) */
"The price changed to %@ since you confirmed. Nothing was sent. Check the new price and confirm again." = "自你确认后价格已变为 %@。未发送任何内容。请查看新价格并再次确认。";
"The price changed to %@ since you confirmed, so nothing was sent. Confirm the new price to continue, or cancel the commit." = "自你确认后价格已变为 %@，因此未发送任何内容。确认新价格以继续，或取消承诺。";
"Confirm New Price" = "确认新价格";

/* .kachat: no offers on expired names, no renewals that stay expired (IOS-055, IOS-056) */
"A renewal starts the next period at the current expiry, not from today, so a name that expired a while ago gets less time. The price goes to the miners." = "续期会从当前到期时间开始下一个期限，而不是从今天开始，因此已过期一段时间的名称获得的时间会更少。费用归矿工。";
"This name has been expired too long to renew. It can only be reclaimed and registered again." = "此名称过期太久，无法续期。只能回收后重新注册。";
"Offers can only be made on active names." = "只能对有效的名称报价。";
"This name has expired. Offers can only be accepted while the name is active. Renew it first." = "此名称已过期。只有在名称有效时才能接受报价。请先续期。";

/* Wallet: import / sign-in stop if the current account can't be backed up (IOS-016) */
"The current account's keys couldn't be backed up on this device, so nothing was changed. Try again." = "无法在此设备上备份当前账户的密钥，因此未做任何更改。请重试。";

/* Seed phrase screen: the passphrase is part of the backup (IOS-017) */
"This wallet also uses a passphrase. You need it together with these words to restore it." = "此钱包还使用了密码短语。恢复时需要它和这些单词一起使用。";
"Passphrase" = "密码短语";

/* Addresses of the other network are refused (IOS-003) */
